On another public story, outside TRIBE v2's training and evaluation sets (Paranoia, Finn et al. 2018; 22 listeners, the whole story: 1,250 volumes = 20.8 minutes at TR 1 s), stock TRIBE v2's forecast was worth about 3 real volunteers, and at least 1. It reached 59% of what the other listeners' average reaches.
What it had to beat: word rate and the sound envelope (beaten in 4 of 4 comparisons).
Fine-tuned TRIBE v2: rule committed, not run (the stock runs' Llama features were not kept).
